      <div type="clause" n="61.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 61.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">7 gif hit hwa gedo, nabbe he Godes mildse, buton he geswice 7 bete, swa biscop getæce.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">and if anyone does so, may he not have God's mercy, unless he desists and atones as the bishop directs.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone does so, let him not have God's mercy, unless he desists and repents as the bishop instructs.</ab>
      </div>
